## 11. What Is Out of Scope

Do not build these. Raise them as platform gaps via `WarningPlaceholder` if encountered.

| ❌ Out of scope | ✅ Use instead |
|---|---|
| Pie charts | `BarChart` + `bar_mode: "stacked_percent"` |
| Scatter / bubble / heatmap charts | Raise as platform gap |
| App-specific UI components | Configure `TableView` / `DetailView` via schema |
| Charts fetching their own data | Charts always receive `dataset` prop |
| Raw `fetch` calls | `apiFetch` from `client.ts` |
| Hardcoded hex colors in components | CSS custom properties from §9 |
| Font sizes not in §10 | Use closest defined level |
| FAB, Bottom Nav, Snackbar | Not in Atlas component set — see `UI_DesignLanguage §10` |
